This folder contains the header files for a "built-in" version of the HepMC3
reference implementation that includes only those components needed to build
MARLEY. The corresponding implementation files have been amalgamated into
src/marley_hepmc3.cc.

Source code for the full HepMC3 library can be obtained from
https://gitlab.cern.ch/hepmc/HepMC3. The source code included in this folder
is redistributed under the terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1 or later. All files in this folder are copyright (C) 2014-2023
by the HepMC Collaboration.

These headers are used when no system HepMC3 installation can be found (or
when IGNORE_HEPMC3 is set). When a system installation is present, the
compiler is directed to its headers instead; the files in this folder are then
not used.
